[ SORT 'XS' BIND XS LENGTH 'LN' BIND XS LN 1 SUB 2 DIV FLOOR GET XS LN 2 DIV FLOOR GET ADD 2 DIV ] 'S0B.MEDIAN' DEF
[ [ ' ' 2 COLLECT ] MAP FLATTEN JOIN TRIM ] 'S0B.SPJOIN' DEF
[ CHARS 'CS' BIND CS 0 GET UPPER CS 1 DROP JOIN 2 COLLECT JOIN ] 'S0B.CAP1' DEF
[ 0 [ ADD ] FOLD ] 'S0B.SUM' DEF
[ 'E' BIND E [ 0 GET ] MAP E [ 1 GET ] MAP GROUP 'R' BIND R KEYS R VALUES [ S0B.SUM ] MAP RECORD ] 'S0B.SUMS' DEF
